+   References:
+   ISO C23 (latest free draft
+   <https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg14/www/docs/n3220.pdf>)
+   sections 6.2.8, 6.7.6.
+   C++11 (latest free draft
+   <https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg21/docs/papers/2011/n3242.pdf>)
+   section 18.10. */
